  triage:verifiedInRound "ttl-reconcile-ay-r1 (content-verified against QA-AY3-R3/R4 evidence)" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "Content-verified fixed on feature/ay3-herdr-endpoint-doctor-config: git show c8bfb76e3:boundaries/atm-core/herdr-endpoint-doctor.toml shows composition.roots narrowed to `[\"atm_herdr::doctor_probe\"]`, no longer including atm_daemon_bootstrap::replacement_handler. Matches commit f8eb4df3d ('fix(boundary): narrow Herdr doctor composition root') in the integrate-ay commit history. This file (boundaries/atm-core/herdr-endpoint-doctor.toml) does not exist on integrate/phase-ay at all (PR #1273 still open/unmerged, confirmed via git merge-base --is-ancestor and file-not-found on integrate HEAD b6f087f92), so this finding has only the single feature-branch occurrence recorded and no separate integrate occurrence to track -- closed fully to fixed, matching QA-AY3-R3 (PASS 0/0/0 at b8afa814f) and QA-AY3-R4 (FAIL only on AY3-QA-002 at c8bfb76e3)." .

